WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.976
Children around the world have different birthday parties.

2
00:00:04.977 --> 00:00:07.278
What do they do?

3
00:00:07.279 --> 00:00:10.463
Hi! I am from Argentina.

4
00:00:10.464 --> 00:00:19.922
At my birthday party, my family and friends pull on my ear seven times because I am seven years old.

5
00:00:19.923 --> 00:00:22.624
Hi! I am from China.

6
00:00:22.625 --> 00:00:29.750
At my birthday party, my family and friends eat noodles together and wish me a long life.

7
00:00:29.751 --> 00:00:32.674
Hi! I am from Denmark.

8
00:00:32.675 --> 00:00:39.325
At my birthday party, my cake is decorated with the Danish flag.

9
00:00:39.326 --> 00:00:42.490
Hi! I am from England.

10
00:00:42.491 --> 00:00:47.429
For my birthday party, my mother bakes a cake with coins in it.

11
00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:53.400
If I find a coin in my piece, I will grow up to be rich.

12
00:00:53.401 --> 00:00:55.926
Hi! I am from India.

13
00:00:55.927 --> 00:01:00.264
On my birthday, I wear a colorful dress to school.

14
00:01:00.265 --> 00:01:05.092
My best friend gives out chocolates to my friends.

15
00:01:05.093 --> 00:01:07.774
Hi! I am from Israel.

16
00:01:07.775 --> 00:01:15.276
At my birthday party, the grown-ups lift me up into the air and put me back down again.

17
00:01:15.277 --> 00:01:18.019
Hi! I am from Korea.

18
00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:23.662
At my birthday party, my mother serves seaweed soup and rice cakes.

19
00:01:23.663 --> 00:01:27.563
My family and friends all eat together.

20
00:01:27.564 --> 00:01:30.292
Hi! I am from Mexico.

21
00:01:30.293 --> 00:01:36.548
At my birthday party, I wear a blindfold and hit a piñata until it breaks open.

22
00:01:36.549 --> 00:01:40.536
Then, we all share the candy inside.

23
00:01:40.537 --> 00:01:43.526
Hi! I am from the Philippines.

24
00:01:43.527 --> 00:01:49.783
Before my birthday party, I go to church with my family to pray.

25
00:01:49.784 --> 00:01:53.113
Hi! I am from the United States.

26
00:01:53.114 --> 00:01:58.873
At my birthday party, I make a wish and blow out the candles on my birthday cake.

27
00:01:58.874 --> 00:02:03.476
If I blow them all out, my wish will come true.

